Dear Trade Partner, 

 

I hope this email finds you well.

 

I'm reaching out to introduce TAASA Luxury Lodges & Camps, which offers
exceptional safari experiences in northern Tanzania through two distinct
properties

 

TAASA Lodge - a luxury lodge in a private concession near the northern
Serengeti

 

*	Wildlife is abundant year-round
*	Experienced guides and trackers
*	Sensitive off-road safaris, available 24/7
*	Open safari vehicles
*	Private game vehicles available
*	Night game drives
*	Guided nature walks
*	Big 5 sightings
*	Stargazing experiences

TAASA Migration Camp - a seasonal mobile camp following the Great Migration

 

*	Dry Season: Kogatende (July - October)
*	Green Season: Ndutu (December - March)
*	Shoulder Season: Mosabi Plains/Mareu (April - June)

 

Both properties offer all-inclusive stays, immersive wildlife encounters,
authentic Maasai cultural visits, and a strong focus on sustainability and
community.

 

We would be delighted to welcome you as a valued partner and look forward to
the opportunity of working together.

 

Please find attached our Fact Sheet and Presentation with more information 

 

You can also view our latest newsletter here:  TAASA Newsletter
<https://mailchi.mp/taasalodge.com/newsletter_q2> - Q2 

 

We look forward to hearing from you

Best regards,

HILLARY CHARLES

